nezha-agent-lite
An independent Zig implementation of the Nezha Agent v0.20.5 core wire protocol.

Protocol reference:
  https://github.com/nezhahq/agent
  The frozen protocol schema is in protocol/nezha-v0.20.5.proto.

HPACK static/Huffman tables follow RFC 7541 and were checked against the
Go HTTP/2 HPACK implementation. The Go Authors' BSD license is retained in
licenses/Go-BSD-3-Clause.txt.

Distributed static executables include Zig standard-library/runtime and musl
components. Their notices are retained in licenses/Zig-MIT.txt and
licenses/musl-COPYRIGHT.txt.

This project is not an official Nezha release and does not implement the
complete Go agent feature set or the current upstream v2 protocol.
